From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] riched20: ITextRange MoveWhile/MoveUntil and FindText families (2028)

ITextRange and ITextSelection: MoveWhile, MoveUntil, MoveStartWhile,
MoveStartUntil, MoveEndWhile, MoveEndUntil (character sets as a string or
as C1_ type bits; both directions; counts; the moved end drags the other
along) and FindText, FindTextStart, FindTextEnd (case, whole-word, counts,
direction), written from the Text Object Model documentation.
---
--- a/dlls/riched20/richole.c
+++ b/dlls/riched20/richole.c
@@ -2381,17 +2381,202 @@
